{{JPExclusive}}
'''Aim GI Nyanko Horse Racing''' (めざせＧＩ にゃんこ競馬, ''Mezase ＧＩ Nyanko Keiba'', '''Aim GI Nyanko Horse Racing''') is a [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 10.10 Update]].

==Overview==
===About===
Aim GI Nyanko Horse Racing contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a stage includes Legend Carrots that can be used on the exclusive [[JRA Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Gacha]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Aim GI Nyanko Horse Racing/Levels 1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Aim GI Nyanko Horse Racing is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

